---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Products
description: A modular scientific software ecosystem — simulation, engineering UI, visualization, and core platform components you can license, customize, or build on.
extraScripts:
  - https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js
  - https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/ScrambleTextPlugin.min.js
---
<header class="page-hero">
  <h1 data-scramble>Products</h1>
  <p class="lede">A modular scientific software ecosystem. Every component is designed to be licensed as-is, customized for your workflow, or used as the foundation for a larger engineering project.</p>
</header>

{%- for cat in site.productCategories %}
<section class="wrap section-block" id="{{ cat.key }}">
  <div class="section-top">
    <h2>{{ cat.name }}</h2>
    <p class="normal">{{ cat.blurb }}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {%- for item in collections.products %}
    {%- if item.data.category == cat.key %}
      {% include "partials/product-card.njk" %}
    {%- endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endfor %}

<section class="wrap section-block">
  <div class="section-top">
    <h2>Don't see what you need?</h2>
    <p class="normal">Products are extended and combined for each engagement — custom development is part of the model.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="button button--primary" href="/engineering/">Engineering &amp; licensing</a>
  </div>
</section>
